\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Unique level-1 RQ prefixes by variant -- level-1 is the first token of the semantic ID, the level constrained beam search prunes on first. (a) Image-side count tracks T$\to $I Recall (3-seed mean) almost monotonically. (b) Text-side prefixes, vanilla vs.\ img3txt0 -- both have $\lambda _{\text  {txt}}=0.0$, yet img3txt0's text codes are visibly restructured: direct evidence that image-side regularization reaches text-side structure through the shared encoder and codebook.}}{11}}
